{"segment_id": "segment_00005", "start": 150.0, "end": 180.0, "speech": "不用过于担心。OK，家庭作业呢？绿皮书一百一十课，各位可以写了，给自己讲解一遍今天的核心知识点。那如果大家喜欢我们的课程，欢迎大家关注、订阅、一键三连，分享给那些需要的朋友。最后我们再来看一句名人名言：The best and most beautiful things in the world cannot be seen or even touched; they must be felt with the heart. See you next", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000023.webp", "time": 151.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Recap", "Patterns", "Grammar", "many/much -more -most", "little -less-least", "Words", "few-fewer-fewest", "good-k", "better - best", "bad-worse", "-worst", "Expression"], "scores": [0.99101, 0.99823, 0.99866, 0.99759, 0.9417, 0.91335, 0.99881, 0.9624, 0.98507, 0.91672, 0.97362, 0.92949, 0.99799], "boxes": [[[1497.0, 50.0], [1737.0, 50.0], [1737.0, 96.0], [1497.0, 96.0]], [[117.0, 60.0], [262.0, 66.0], [259.0, 118.0], [114.0, 112.0]], [[152.0, 284.0], [348.0, 290.0], [347.0, 338.0], [151.0, 332.0]], [[138.0, 381.0], [364.0, 386.0], [363.0, 433.0], [137.0, 427.0]], [[420.0, 551.0], [928.0, 546.0], [928.0, 594.0], [420.0, 600.0]], [[421.0, 595.0], [754.0, 599.0], [754.0, 644.0], [421.0, 641.0]], [[168.0, 638.0], [332.0, 641.0], [331.0, 695.0], [167.0, 693.0]], [[417.0, 643.0], [808.0, 646.0], [808.0, 695.0], [417.0, 692.0]], [[418.0, 699.0], [582.0, 693.0], [584.0, 745.0], [420.0, 751.0]], [[560.0, 699.0], [811.0, 697.0], [811.0, 740.0], [560.0, 743.0]], [[420.0, 743.0], [667.0, 746.0], [667.0, 792.0], [420.0, 790.0]], [[649.0, 754.0], [792.0, 754.0], [792.0, 788.0], [649.0, 788.0]], [[118.0, 902.0], [382.0, 906.0], [381.0, 966.0], [117.0, 963.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000024.webp", "time": 153.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "绿皮书第110课的写作练习"], "scores": [0.95313, 0.9887], "boxes": [[[1496.0, 49.0], [1739.0, 49.0], [1739.0, 95.0], [1496.0, 95.0]], [[240.0, 235.0], [761.0, 235.0], [761.0, 285.0], [240.0, 285.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000025.webp", "time": 158.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "C"], "scores": [0.99327, 0.84801], "boxes": [[[1497.0, 50.0], [1737.0, 50.0], [1737.